  '以離峰同模型費率換算；尖峰／離峰費率同步變動，不改變官方等值倍率': 'Converted at off-peak same-model rates; peak/off-peak rates move together, so the official-equivalence multiplier is unchanged',
  '同套餐不同模型情境不能相加；超額啟用 Zen balance 會另計費': 'Same-plan model scenarios are not additive; overage with Zen balance enabled is billed separately',
  '每token報價已確認；倍率為未含付款處理費的上限': 'Per-token pricing confirmed; the multiplier is a ceiling excluding payment processing fees',
  '截至 2026-09-12：以同方案、同口徑的月 API 等價值作截尾算術平均；納入樣本 weight>0，weight=0 僅保留作旁證。可重現、同口徑樣本取平均；不可重現的高值、促銷／上限情境與同一原始研究的二手轉述不納入。倍率＝納入樣本平均 API 等值／$20；全部樣本仍保留於詳情。': 'As of 2026-09-12: trimmed arithmetic mean of monthly API-equivalent values for the same plan and same methodology; samples with weight>0 included, weight=0 kept only as corroboration. Reproducible, same-methodology samples are averaged; non-reproducible highs, promo/ceiling scenarios, and secondhand retellings of the same original research are excluded. Multiplier = mean API equivalent of included samples / $20; all samples remain in the details.',
  '2026-09-12 多來源重算：納入 Devforth $435、Real API Pricing $336.336、Reddit ccusage $571，算術平均 $447.45／月，倍率 22.37×。Reddit $850 個人值與 CodeSOTA $700 最大使用二手值保留於詳情，但不納入中心值。': '2026-09-12 multi-source recompute: Devforth $435, Real API Pricing $336.336, and Reddit ccusage $571 included — arithmetic mean $447.45/mo, multiplier 22.37×. The Reddit $850 personal figure and CodeSOTA $700 secondhand max-usage value are kept in details but excluded from the central value.',
  '保留個人日誌觀測，但高於其他近期估算且沒有完整可重現 ledger；依去除極端／低可核對樣本規則，不納入中心平均。': 'Personal-ledger observation retained, but above other recent estimates and lacking a fully reproducible ledger; under the extreme/low-verifiability exclusion rule it is not included in the central mean.',
  '二手整理的 SemiAnalysis 最大使用情境：Plus 約 $700/月；與其他方案的同一原始研究只算旁證，不納入平均。': 'Secondhand SemiAnalysis max-usage scenario: Plus ~$700/mo; the same original research under other plans counts only as corroboration, not in the average.',
  '截至 2026-09-12：以同方案、同口徑的月 API 等價值作算術平均；納入樣本 weight>0，weight=0 僅保留作旁證。三個可重現／可追溯來源均納入，倍率＝納入樣本平均 API 等值／$100；全部樣本仍保留於詳情。': 'As of 2026-09-12: arithmetic mean of monthly API-equivalent values for the same plan and same methodology; weight>0 included, weight=0 kept only as corroboration. All three reproducible/traceable sources are included. Multiplier = mean API equivalent / $100; all samples remain in the details.',
  '2026-09-12 多來源重算：納入 Devforth $2,783、Reddit controlled ccusage $2,600、Real API Pricing $1,681.68，算術平均 $2,354.89／月，倍率 23.55×。CodeSOTA $3,500 最大使用二手值保留於詳情，但不納入中心值。': '2026-09-12 multi-source recompute: Devforth $2,783, Reddit controlled ccusage $2,600, and Real API Pricing $1,681.68 included — arithmetic mean $2,354.89/mo, multiplier 23.55×. The CodeSOTA $3,500 secondhand max-usage value is kept in details but excluded from the central value.',
  '二手整理的 SemiAnalysis 最大使用情境：Pro 5x 約 $3,500/月；與其他方案的同一原始研究只算旁證，不納入平均。': 'Secondhand SemiAnalysis max-usage scenario: Pro 5x ~$3,500/mo; the same original research under other plans counts only as corroboration, not in the average.',
  'API 等價是按官方標準 API 費率換算，不是供應商成本、官方保證配額或一般使用者平均。Codex issue 的週額度推算未耗盡完整窗口；模型、effort、快取、任務形狀、帳戶與額度帳務差異都可能改變結果。': 'API equivalence is converted at official standard API rates — not provider cost, guaranteed quota, or average-user usage. The Codex issue\u2019s weekly-quota projection did not exhaust the full window; model, effort, cache, task shape, account, and quota-billing differences can all change the result.',
  '截至 2026-09-12：先保留四個同方案月等價樣本，再做 25% 截尾算術平均，去除最高與最低值。納入中心值為 Reddit tracker $10,320 與 Codex issue #43731 的 Sol／Astra 模型中點 $6,844.48，倍率＝平均 $8,582.24／$200＝42.91×；全部原始與異常資料仍保留於詳情。': 'As of 2026-09-12: four same-plan monthly-equivalence samples retained, then a 25% trimmed arithmetic mean drops the highest and lowest. The central value includes the Reddit tracker $10,320 and the Codex issue #43731 Sol/Astra model midpoint $6,844.48 — multiplier = mean $8,582.24 / $200 = 42.91×; all original and anomalous data remain in the details.',
  '2026-09-12 多來源重算：以四個可比樣本做 25% 截尾平均；保留 Devforth $11,131、Real API Pricing $6,726.72、Reddit $10,320 與 Codex issue #43731 模型中點 $6,844.48。去除最高與最低後，中心值為 $8,582.24／月，倍率 42.91×。Codex issue #38367 的約 $800／週是待查帳務異常，CodeSOTA $14,000 是同一 SemiAnalysis 研究的二手最大值，均不納入。': '2026-09-12 multi-source recompute: four comparable samples, 25% trimmed mean — Devforth $11,131, Real API Pricing $6,726.72, Reddit $10,320, and the Codex issue #43731 model midpoint $6,844.48 retained. After dropping the highest and lowest, the central value is $8,582.24/mo, multiplier 42.91×. The ~$800/week in Codex issue #38367 is a billing anomaly under investigation, and CodeSOTA $14,000 is a secondhand maximum from the same SemiAnalysis research — both excluded.',
  '觀測聚合值 $11,131；在四個可比樣本的 25% 截尾規則中屬最高值，保留但不納入中心平均。': 'Aggregated observation $11,131; the highest under the 25% trim rule across four comparable samples — retained but excluded from the central mean.',
  '12.32B Sol tokens/month × $0.546/MTok normalized API blend；在截尾規則中屬最低值，保留但不納入中心平均。': '12.32B Sol tokens/month × $0.546/MTok normalized API blend; the lowest under the trim rule — retained but excluded from the central mean.',
  'Comment cites trackers around $2,400/week for the 20x plan; converted with 4.3 weeks/month. Community corroboration, not a published raw ledger；納入截尾後中心平均。': 'Comment cites trackers around $2,400/week for the 20x plan; converted with 4.3 weeks/month. Community corroboration, not a published raw ledger — included in the post-trim central mean.',
  '同一 Pro 20x 帳戶：Sol $1,924.58／週 × 52/12 = $8,339.85／月；Astra $1,234.41／週 × 52/12 = $5,349.11／月；兩者模型中點 $6,844.48。作者明確說是 normalization estimate，未耗盡完整週額度；納入截尾後中心平均。': 'Same Pro 20x account: Sol $1,924.58/week × 52/12 = $8,339.85/mo; Astra $1,234.41/week × 52/12 = $5,349.11/mo; model midpoint $6,844.48. The author explicitly calls it a normalization estimate that did not exhaust the full weekly quota — included in the post-trim central mean.',
